            <td><div style="font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);">State Dept: "Personally responsible for managing GAESA's illicit assets held internationally."</div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><div class="sdn14-nm">Moa Nickel S.A. (MNSA)</div><div class="sdn14-sb">50/50 JV · Sherritt International (Canada) + Cuba's General Nickel Company</div></td>
