      <div class="nc14">
        <span class="nc14-ic">⚠️</span>
        <span class="nc14-tx">OFAC's FAQ 1254 clarified that US secondary sanctions apply to foreign parties dealing with GAESA. OFAC issued a limited non-targeting posture through June 5, 2026 for wind-down transactions — that grace period has now expired. All transactions with GAESA and its 50%+ subsidiaries now carry full sanctions exposure.</span>
